  "reasoning": "The defendants stole oil from a pipeline and a van, concealed the stolen items, and caused a fire while extracting the oil. The primary illegal act is theft of oil and the vehicle, which corresponds to the charge '盗窃'. Their concealment of the stolen vehicle and oil fits the charge '掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益'. The fire that resulted from their illegal oil extraction, without evidence of intentional arson, matches the charge '失火' (negligent fire).",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;掩饰、隐瞒犯罪所得、犯罪所得收益;失火<eoa>"
}
